    <string name="drive_work_perm_title">Location permission for WLAN names</string>
    <string name="drive_work_perm_explain">GateControl collects location data to recognise the name of the connected WLAN and sort new photos into work and private photos – also when the app is closed or not in use. The location never leaves your device and is not stored; only the WLAN name and the time stay on this phone for 30 days. For it to work in the background, then choose “Allow all the time” in the settings.</string>
    <string name="drive_work_bg_title">Location in the background</string>
    <string name="drive_work_bg_explain">GateControl collects location data to recognise the name of the connected WLAN also when the app is closed or not in use – only then do photos taken in the company or at home end up in the right place by themselves. The location never leaves your device and is not stored. Choose “Allow all the time” on the next page.</string>
